WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:07.029
Speaker 1: . A New York City is now putting
in place the strictest vaccine mandate in

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:08.180
the country.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:12.690
This is Bill de Blasio, New York City mayor,
on his way out.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.690
Remember with incoming Mayor Eric Adams replacing
him soon?

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:21.430
Here's what's going on in New York City starting
on December 27th and maybe specifically timed

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:26.920
in advance of New Year's Eve, New York City's
vaccine mandate will expand to all private

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.080
sector workers.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:36.910
The what counts as vaccination will change
to two doses rather than one.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:43.610
Kids aged five to 11 will be subject to the
vaccination mandate and all will have to show

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:49.050
proof of full vaccination, meaning two doses
to do indoor dining and to go to other activities

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.770
starting December 14th, which is a week from
today.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:59.239
This is all sort of happening in the context
of Omicron, even as we don't know exactly

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:00.460
what the outlook is.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:05.140
As I just told you, it appears to be more
contagious and early data suggests it is less

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:06.289
severe.

00:01:06.289 --> 00:01:07.689
Now there's a couple of questions here.

00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:13.429
One of the big questions is OK, grades a vaccine
mandate, vaccinate or else or else what?

00:01:13.429 --> 00:01:15.139
And it's not totally clear yet.

00:01:15.139 --> 00:01:20.329
And the or else what some legal experts are
saying is what could determine whether this

00:01:20.329 --> 00:01:22.329
stands up to a court challenge.

00:01:22.329 --> 00:01:30.279
Now I'm just being upfront on the one hand
for these types of mandates, just actual straight

00:01:30.279 --> 00:01:32.740
up mandates being legal.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:33.740
Is this?

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:41.429
I believe it's Jacobson v. Massachusetts case
from nineteen oh three and the smallpox vaccine

00:01:41.429 --> 00:01:47.539
that continues to be what we point to and
say these these mandates are legal.

00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:53.601
When the idea of a federal mandate was brought
up, there were questions about, well, would

00:01:53.601 --> 00:01:59.200
Jacobson v. Massachusetts, which was a local
mandate in the city of Cambridge?

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.700
I believe it was Cambridge.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.560
Would that apply to a federal vaccine meant?

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.109
Well, it's not really clear.

00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:11.860
Well, it seems that state and local vaccine
mandates are more likely to pass muster.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:15.920
But then another wrinkle to this one lawyer
I spoke to this this morning mentioned is

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:21.750
what is the or else if it's just a fine, if
you don't get vaccinated, that's more likely

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.310
to stand up to a court challenge.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:26.360
If it's something else that we don't yet know.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.360
Maybe it won't.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.950
I think almost certainly there is going to
be a legal challenge to this.

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:36.130
I have no idea what the outcome of that would
be.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.950
One thing we know is that vaccine mandates
work now that doesn't tell us whether they

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:45.820
are legally OK, and that doesn't tell us whether
they are morally OK.

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:49.780
Those are different issues which each of us
can grapple with, and I tend to think that

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.730
they are OK.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:57.311
But vaccine mandates work, and despite all
of the hyperbolic and histrionic claims, every

00:02:57.311 --> 00:03:03.460
time such a mandate is put in place that everybody
is going to quit, 20 percent of the NYPD is

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.640
going to quit.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:10.151
We end up with between half and one percent
of any particular workforce saying, that's

00:03:10.151 --> 00:03:13.190
too much and I'm going to bail, so they do
work.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:17.000
The reality is that at some point.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.290
We don't know when.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:21.830
My hope is that it's sooner, but it may be
years at some point.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.350
COVID becomes less severe.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:28.090
That's generally the evolution of these viruses.

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:33.300
Check out my interview again with Vincent
Racaniello from a few weeks ago.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:41.710
Once that happens, it would seem logical that
the COVID vaccine would go back to being the

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:46.720
same sort of status as the flu vaccine, which
is some people get it and some people don't.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.930
And it's not a big controversy in this way.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:57.700
Let me know your thoughts about what New York
City is doing, and I'm less and less curious

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:58.700
legally.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.160
Courts will sort that out.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.400
I'm less curious in terms of efficacy.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.100
We know that they work morally speaking.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.150
Where are you on vaccine mandates like this?

